<title>USA: First Southwest says San Marcos, Texas, deal set.</title>
<headline>First Southwest says San Marcos, Texas, deal set.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-12-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>San Marcos, Texas, plans to sell $2 million waterworks and sewer system revenue bonds on Monday, the financial adviser, First Southwest Co, said Thursday.</p>
<p>The city plans to purchase insurance from Financial Security Assurance for the deal, set for 1600 EST.</p>
<p>--Steven Dickson, 212-859-1652</p>
</text>
